--------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Purpose

Set beta-equilibrated temperature and electron fraction, using EoS slices produced by the python routine 'SlicerAndConverter'. Make sure that you're using the same EoS that has been using for generating initial data.


2. How to use it

In parfile, you need to set some parameters:
    Spritz_SetBeta::beta_datafile    = [Path to EoS slice, e.g. [...]/EosName/eos]
    EOS_Omni::nuceos_table_name      = [Path to .h5 eos in stellarcollapse format]
    HydroBase::initial_temperature   = "Spritz_SetBeta"
    HydroBase::initial_Y_e           = "Spritz_SetBeta"
    HydroBase::initial_entropy       = "Spritz_SetBeta"
